$ gragas version --help
--- stdout

  Which gragas this is: its release tag, the commit it was built
  from, the Go release that built it, the target, and the
  format and contract versions it reads. --json gives the same
  as one JSON document.

    gragas version
    gragas --version
    gragas version --json

  USAGE


    gragas version [--flags]


  FLAGS

    --accessible  Plain questions (ACCESSIBLE)
    --config      The settings file (GRAGAS_CONFIG)
    -h --help     Help for version
    --json        Answer in one JSON document
    --no-color    No colour (NO_COLOR)
    --plain       Print plainly: nothing moves

--- stderr
--- exit 0
